 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt8196-mcu.c        | 96 +++++++-------------
 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt8196-mfg.c        | 84 +++++------------
 3 files changed, 63 insertions(+), 184 deletions(-)

